+  Random(range) term in Rnd's own Min+Random(range) formula below, same as
+  the C# side's Rnd(lo,hi) => lo+random.Next(...) wrapping FixedRandom), so
+  results are directly comparable to existing golden files generated against
+  that same convention. -1 (the default) means "use the real RNG," unchanged
+  from source. }
+VAR
+   ForcedRandomValue: Integer;
+
